 YesOrNoAutoPress;myGuiParms;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" aand a "No" button together with a message; presses "Cancel" automatically after 3 secs.
 myGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←##.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.timeout←4
 parms.autoPress←1
 parms.size←150 500
 parms.statusbarMessage←'This message is shown in the status bar, and it will define the width of the dialog box'
 ⎕←parms myGuiParms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo'Are you really sure?'
⍝Done
